# Python development guide

- Use the project .venv and keep dependencies reproducible
- Follow PEP 8, use descriptive snake_case names and type hints for public functions
- Keep functions focused, handle exceptions explicitly and use logging for diagnostics
- Keep credentials in environment variables, never in source control
- Use Ruff for formatting and linting, and pytest for affected behavior

## Project directories

- main.py: Agent entry point
- .venv/: project Python environment
- tests/: add focused tests when needed

